Niña...

265
00:20:13,379 --> 00:20:14,380
Auxilio.

266
00:20:16,716 --> 00:20:17,926
¡Niña, salta!

267
00:20:18,968 --> 00:20:20,053
¡Auxilio!

268
00:20:26,476 --> 00:20:28,520
