272
00:20:48,706 --> 00:20:49,833
La hora, son las...

273
00:20:50,834 --> 00:20:51,835
13:55 PM.

274
00:20:53,128 --> 00:20:55,936
<i>Encontré al otro lado de
la montaña Niuguan</i>

275
00:20:55,938 --> 00:20:57,865
